# 1. PROJECT IDENTITY

Product name: DEDSEC AI FORENSIC ASSISTANT

Product category: AI-powered illustrative facial-composite creation and editing platform.

Product vision:

Build a premium, commercially presentable web application that converts detailed natural-language descriptions into realistic black-and-white graphite-style illustrative facial composites.

Users must be able to describe fictional adult facial characteristics using either:

1. Text input.
2. Voice input.

The application should extract facial attributes, allow users to review and edit them, generate a composite, refine the existing result, save cases and export the final work.

DEDSEC must feel like a professional commercial software product, not a basic student project or generic AI dashboard.

The most important feature is high-quality image generation.

The application must combine:

- Premium Apple-inspired UI.
- AI-powered facial profile extraction.
- Text-to-image generation.
- Voice-to-text processing.
- Facial attribute editing.
- Image-to-image refinement.
- Case management.
- Image and PDF export.
- User authentication.
- Subscription management.
- Payment integration.
- Usage and cost monitoring.
- Protected administration dashboard.

